<title>USA: Bloomington, Minn., $1.240 mln won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Bloomington, Minn., $1.240 mln won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $1.240 million of Bloomington, Minn., general obligation storm water revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 4.58 percent.</p>
</text>
